---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/article.css';

const title = 'Start Here | Ted Johnson Works';
const description = 'Choose the next practical step: build something useful, get direct technology help, strengthen everyday computer skills, use AI confidently, or make a better buying decision.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="site-shell nav">
      <a class="brand" href="/">TED JOHNSON <span>WORKS</span></a>
      <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <a href="/">Works</a>
        <a href="/start" aria-current="page">Start Here</a>
        <a href="/picks">Ted’s Picks</a>
        <a href="/#articles">Stories & Articles</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main">
    <section class="article-hero">
      <div class="site-shell">
        <div class="article-hero-panel">
          <p class="eyebrow">START HERE</p>
          <h1>One need. One useful next step.</h1>
          <p class="article-dek">You do not need to wander through the whole site. Pick the problem that sounds most like yours and go straight there.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="site-shell">
        <div class="start-grid">
          <article class="start-card">
            <p class="eyebrow">BUILD SOMETHING</p>
            <h2>I have an idea and I want to get something real finished.</h2>
            <p><em>BUILD IT IN ONE DAY</em> is a practical one-day production system for using AI to build the foundation, create something useful, test it, publish it, and get more of your day back.</p>
            <div class="actions">
              <a class="button button-gold" href="https://payhip.com/b/xSaZe" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get BUILD IT IN ONE DAY · $7.76 Launch</a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="start-card">
            <p class="eyebrow">DIRECT HELP</p>
            <h2>I have one technology problem and I need an answer.</h2>
            <p>Thirty focused minutes for one confusing message, technology problem, purchase decision, or next step.</p>
            <div class="actions">
              <a class="button button-gold" href="https://payhip.com/b/W6nhP" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a Technology Clarity Call</a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="start-card">
            <p class="eyebrow">COMPUTER SKILLS</p>
            <h2>I want the computer skills everyone seems to expect me to already know.</h2>
            <p><em>The Computer Skills Nobody Taught You</em> is a plain-English starting point for practical everyday computer skills without unnecessary jargon.</p>
            <div class="actions">
              <a class="button button-gold" href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=The+Computer+Skills+Nobody+Taught+You+Theodore+Johnson" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Find the Book on Amazon</a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="start-card">
            <p class="eyebrow">PRACTICAL AI</p>
            <h2>I want to use AI without becoming an AI expert.</h2>
            <p>Start with plain-English guidance for better questions, verification, writing, research, problem-solving, and everyday decisions.</p>
            <div class="actions">
              <a class="button button-gold" href="/articles/ai-for-people-who-dont-want-to-become-ai-experts">Start with Practical AI</a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="start-card">
            <p class="eyebrow">EVERYDAY TECHNOLOGY</p>
            <h2>I want to feel more confident with the technology I already use.</h2>
            <p>Everyday Tech Confidence is built for ordinary users who want practical steps without jargon or unnecessary complexity.</p>
            <div class="actions">
              <a class="button button-gold" href="https://payhip.com/b/mX6EL" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Everyday Tech Confidence</a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="start-card">
            <p class="eyebrow">BUYING DECISIONS</p>
            <h2>I am trying to decide what is actually worth paying for.</h2>
            <p>Ted’s Picks is the separate recommendation board: what a product solves, who it is for, why it earned a spot, and when to skip it.</p>
            <div class="actions">
              <a class="button button-gold" href="/picks">Explore Ted’s Picks</a>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="site-shell footer-row">
      <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Ted Johnson Works. Useful first. Commercial second.</p>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/photography">Photography · Developing</a>
        <a href="/picks">Ted’s Picks</a>
        <a href="#main">Back to top</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</BaseLayout>
